WEBVTT

01:40.750 --> 01:44.220
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.100 --> 01:47.120
[Episode 30]

01:49.039 --> 01:51.560
Kill him! Kill him!

01:51.710 --> 01:52.590
Kill him!

02:01.920 --> 02:03.150
How dare you?

02:03.230 --> 02:04.560
Why wouldn't I dare?

02:08.870 --> 02:10.360
This is meant to imprison a god.

02:12.360 --> 02:13.710
I don't want to be a god anymore.

02:16.000 --> 02:17.470
You can't trap me.

02:31.240 --> 02:33.000
Do you know what a god is?

02:37.800 --> 02:39.120
Hou Yi saved the world,

02:40.560 --> 02:41.910
shooting down the suns with his bow.

02:43.150 --> 02:44.520
Yu the Great controlled the floods,

02:45.280 --> 02:46.590
bringing peace to his people.

02:48.590 --> 02:49.910
Kuafu chased the sun

02:50.470 --> 02:51.840
and died pursuing his ambition.

02:52.710 --> 02:54.150
Shennong tasted countless herbs,

02:55.310 --> 02:56.750
benefiting all living creatures.

03:03.450 --> 03:05.120
They were all once human—

03:06.080 --> 03:06.960
brave,

03:07.870 --> 03:08.710
resolute,

03:09.430 --> 03:10.280
selfless,

03:11.080 --> 03:11.910
compassionate,

03:12.750 --> 03:13.840
and fearless.

03:15.680 --> 03:16.360
But you...

03:18.690 --> 03:19.970
you want to imprison me?

03:29.079 --> 03:30.750
You're not worthy to represent the human race!

03:31.190 --> 03:33.400
I won't kill you. I want you to live.

03:33.710 --> 03:35.470
I want you, a narrow-minded scumbag,

03:35.490 --> 03:36.600
to see

03:37.079 --> 03:38.450
how all things in the four seasons,

03:39.420 --> 03:40.540
in their rise and fall,

03:41.310 --> 03:43.240
will find their own path

03:44.520 --> 03:46.630
without relying on a demon's guidance.

04:50.320 --> 04:51.320
Zhi Yue,

04:51.370 --> 04:52.930
demon slayer from Yandu.

04:53.070 --> 04:54.000
Lord Wenying,

04:54.000 --> 04:55.800
demon slayer from Fangwai Mountain.

04:55.800 --> 04:57.750
Lv Chengshi from Fangwai Mountain.

04:58.000 --> 04:58.920
Slay the demon!

04:59.390 --> 05:02.190
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:02.190 --> 05:05.000
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:05.040 --> 05:07.750
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:07.870 --> 05:10.800
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:11.040 --> 05:13.830
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:13.830 --> 05:16.600
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:16.600 --> 05:20.430
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:20.510 --> 05:24.630
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:43.290 --> 05:47.409
Slay the demon! Slay the demon! Slay the demon!

05:56.320 --> 05:58.090
What a grand show.

05:59.340 --> 06:01.390
So many righteous demon slayers.

06:02.990 --> 06:05.080
Since you all want to kill me,

06:06.910 --> 06:08.470
then bring it on.

06:29.800 --> 06:30.700
Fire!

06:54.210 --> 06:55.010
Yuanzhong.

07:07.830 --> 07:08.630
Yuanzhong.

07:09.630 --> 07:10.430
Yuanzhong.

07:14.270 --> 07:15.190
I'm here.

07:17.630 --> 07:18.580
Ji Tanyin.

07:25.000 --> 07:25.800
Look.

07:27.800 --> 07:29.480
Even in such a filthy place,

07:30.870 --> 07:34.430
two little flowers have managed to bloom.

07:51.270 --> 07:52.960
Who is this person?

07:57.040 --> 07:58.240
Who... who is she?

07:58.240 --> 07:59.040
Who is she?

07:59.310 --> 08:02.070
I'm Ji Tanyin from Liujiao Palace.

08:02.680 --> 08:06.070
All soldiers, release the arrows!

08:25.680 --> 08:26.790
Catch them.

08:27.160 --> 08:28.560
Don't let them escape!

08:28.920 --> 08:29.720
Yes!

08:31.100 --> 08:32.380
We're not escaping.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.630
This city was built by me.

08:35.510 --> 08:36.549
The origin of everything; the root of all energy;

08:36.549 --> 08:37.840
the source of wisdom; the return of all creation.

08:37.840 --> 08:39.080
Yandu, retract!

08:46.930 --> 08:48.330
Even if I've lost my divine bone,

08:49.430 --> 08:50.860
it's still at my disposal.

09:01.630 --> 09:02.440
Yuanzhong.

09:04.840 --> 09:05.720
Let's go.

09:57.790 --> 09:59.150
They're just ahead. After them!

10:09.080 --> 10:10.840
-How is it?
-Young City Lord.

10:11.390 --> 10:12.440
Tanghua of the Youhu Clan

10:12.440 --> 10:13.360
and that War Demon

10:13.360 --> 10:14.510
were caught in the chaos.

10:14.510 --> 10:15.480
They're now in the dungeon,

10:15.480 --> 10:16.480
awaiting punishment.

10:18.550 --> 10:19.750
As for the High Priest,

10:20.120 --> 10:21.030
Chief Li Chaoyang

10:21.030 --> 10:22.240
personally led people to pursue him.

10:22.630 --> 10:23.870
I've also secretly sent assassins

10:23.870 --> 10:24.870
from the martial world after him.

10:24.910 --> 10:26.320
It should be foolproof.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.200
What about Zhi Dai?

10:28.200 --> 10:29.120
She hasn't been found yet.

10:29.360 --> 10:30.270
Find her quickly.

10:30.750 --> 10:32.910
Make sure to kill her this time.

10:33.960 --> 10:34.550
Yes.

10:37.800 --> 10:39.250
Ji Tanyin…

10:41.200 --> 10:43.480
Who on earth is she?

10:58.720 --> 11:00.440
Greetings, my lords.

11:00.440 --> 11:01.840
May I ask why you've

11:01.840 --> 11:03.150
summoned us here?

11:03.240 --> 11:04.600
Goddess Wushuang

11:04.840 --> 11:06.670
has disappeared

11:06.750 --> 11:07.960
from the Divine Registry.

11:10.150 --> 11:11.320
How is that possible?

11:11.650 --> 11:12.560
Just now,

11:12.870 --> 11:14.750
the Temple of Wushuang

11:14.750 --> 11:15.870
also crumbled into dust.

11:15.870 --> 11:16.550
Well...

11:16.870 --> 11:18.080
How could this happen?

11:18.320 --> 11:19.480
Goddess Wushuang

11:19.480 --> 11:21.220
might have perished in the mortal realm,

11:21.550 --> 11:23.960
or perhaps someone took her divine bone

11:24.270 --> 11:25.390
and destroyed her divinity,

11:25.390 --> 11:27.240
causing the heavenly way to no longer see her as a god.

11:28.030 --> 11:29.820
When was the last time she returned?

11:30.320 --> 11:31.440
Was there anything unusual?

11:32.720 --> 11:33.790
My lord,

11:34.120 --> 11:35.080
Goddess Wushuang

11:35.080 --> 11:36.910
returned a few days ago.

11:37.000 --> 11:38.240
But she left in a hurry,

11:38.240 --> 11:39.080
without saying much

11:39.080 --> 11:40.480
about what happened in the mortal realm.

11:41.150 --> 11:43.000
Many people worship you in the mortal realm.

11:43.510 --> 11:44.910
Can you use them

11:45.000 --> 11:46.720
to find out what happened

11:46.720 --> 11:48.270
to Goddess Wushuang?

11:48.670 --> 11:49.670
My lord,

11:49.670 --> 11:51.320
your command is my duty.

12:26.550 --> 12:27.360
Mr. Loong.

12:30.630 --> 12:31.660
Why are you here?

12:32.630 --> 12:34.210
I was thinking about Taihe

12:34.440 --> 12:36.320
and happened to pass by,

12:36.440 --> 12:38.870
so I came to check on him.

12:39.600 --> 12:41.440
At the Discipline Hall,

12:41.600 --> 12:42.790
you seemed

12:42.930 --> 12:44.560
to have something to say, right?

12:46.600 --> 12:47.840
Did I?

12:47.840 --> 12:48.790
Didn't you?

12:50.000 --> 12:51.200
Don't you want to know

12:51.200 --> 12:52.270
why Tanyin and I

12:52.270 --> 12:53.860
had a big fight that day?

12:54.000 --> 12:55.080
Don't you want to know

12:55.390 --> 12:56.910
why I used an embroidery piece

12:56.910 --> 12:58.390
to seal the Ascension Platform

12:58.510 --> 13:00.630
and prevented her primordial spirit

13:00.750 --> 13:02.270
from returning to the Divine Realm?

13:02.550 --> 13:04.870
Then what did you do?

13:04.870 --> 13:06.370
Whatever I did,

13:06.670 --> 13:08.750
it was all for Taihe's sake.

13:09.840 --> 13:10.960
Tanyin is young.

13:11.270 --> 13:12.940
We should help her more

13:13.080 --> 13:15.200
and not let her act recklessly

13:15.220 --> 13:16.610
or go astray.

13:18.120 --> 13:18.910
Mr. Loong,

13:19.270 --> 13:21.080
you and I have been friends for thousands of years.

13:21.440 --> 13:22.960
You should know very well

13:23.550 --> 13:26.080
that I always put Taihe first

13:26.080 --> 13:28.080
and have no selfish intentions.

13:31.080 --> 13:32.960
You're right. You're right.

13:32.980 --> 13:35.340
The priority is to retrieve the Divine Hand

13:35.390 --> 13:37.670
and revive Taihe.

15:46.600 --> 15:48.210
Chief, they ran that way.

15:49.670 --> 15:50.480
After them!

16:01.750 --> 16:02.600
Tanyin.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.080
Tanyin.

16:06.910 --> 16:07.720
I'm here.

16:09.080 --> 16:10.390
I've always been here.

16:11.390 --> 16:12.200
Run.

16:13.910 --> 16:14.960
Run.

16:16.790 --> 16:18.550
Run.

16:18.870 --> 16:20.150
I'm not going anywhere.

16:21.050 --> 16:22.680
I'll always be with you.

16:24.390 --> 16:25.720
I promised

16:26.120 --> 16:27.240
to be good to you

16:27.980 --> 16:29.190
and stay with you.

17:00.840 --> 17:01.630
You're awake?

17:03.670 --> 17:04.920
In a place like this,

17:05.240 --> 17:07.109
you could actually sleep so soundly.

17:07.240 --> 17:08.510
What's wrong with this place?

17:09.000 --> 17:10.829
It shelters me from the wind and rain,

17:11.000 --> 17:12.750
much better than where I used to live.

17:13.030 --> 17:13.829
But I understand.

17:14.240 --> 17:16.510
You're the commander of the Youhu Clan's War Division.

17:16.680 --> 17:17.750
Naturally,

17:18.030 --> 17:19.400
you're not used to places like this.

17:22.160 --> 17:23.480
You're a War Demon.

17:24.069 --> 17:25.480
So why did you help Yuanzhong?

17:26.030 --> 17:27.160
What's wrong with being a War Demon?

17:27.160 --> 17:27.680
War Demons

17:27.680 --> 17:29.310
are sworn enemies of the Youhu Clan.

17:29.480 --> 17:30.290
Is that so?

17:32.000 --> 17:33.710
Then why did your clan's elder

17:33.830 --> 17:35.750
join forces with our chief

17:36.160 --> 17:37.750
to kill your High Priest?

17:38.750 --> 17:40.310
Can you really make sense

17:40.680 --> 17:41.920
of all the grudges and feuds in this world?

17:43.790 --> 17:44.750
You're right.

17:47.350 --> 17:48.750
Besides, I didn't do that for him.

17:50.200 --> 17:51.350
Then who did you do it for?

17:52.200 --> 17:53.550
You're talking too much.

17:54.030 --> 17:55.550
Seems like you're really bored.

17:56.260 --> 17:57.700
Why don't you think about how to escape instead?

17:58.510 --> 18:00.000
That god gave the order.

18:00.400 --> 18:01.590
I bet the whole world

18:01.590 --> 18:03.000
is after Yuanzhong now.

18:03.240 --> 18:04.510
With no help from anyone,

18:04.680 --> 18:05.880
how many times can they escape?

18:06.200 --> 18:07.510
Did you hear what those jailers

18:07.510 --> 18:08.640
were saying earlier?

18:09.160 --> 18:09.960
They said Miss Ji

18:09.960 --> 18:11.680
made Yandu shrink

18:12.030 --> 18:13.200
and then threw it out.

18:13.400 --> 18:14.830
In the blink of an eye, Yandu was moved

18:14.830 --> 18:15.790
over 250 miles.

18:17.240 --> 18:18.590
Do you think that's possible?

18:20.510 --> 18:21.480
Whether it's possible or not,

18:22.510 --> 18:24.110
we'll know once we get out.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.960
If that really happened,

18:27.480 --> 18:28.850
she must have used divine power.

18:44.200 --> 18:45.640
Zhi Dai, are you alright?

18:45.640 --> 18:46.680
How did you get here?

18:46.720 --> 18:48.410
Time is short. Let's talk outside.

18:48.680 --> 18:49.880
With this thing restraining us,

18:49.880 --> 18:50.830
we have no spiritual power.

18:50.830 --> 18:51.640
Solve this first.

18:55.160 --> 18:55.680
Let's go.

18:55.680 --> 18:56.550
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

19:09.930 --> 19:10.930
City Lord,

19:11.550 --> 19:12.550
Tanghua has escaped.

19:14.270 --> 19:15.080
What?

19:24.680 --> 19:26.070
You can't escape, can you?

19:35.960 --> 19:36.960
One of them

19:37.030 --> 19:38.950
is the commander of the Youhu Clan's War Division,

19:39.200 --> 19:40.200
and the other

19:40.330 --> 19:42.370
is a War Demon who can fight 100 men alone.

19:42.590 --> 19:44.240
Do you really think you can take them down

19:44.400 --> 19:45.960
with these black-armored guards?

19:46.160 --> 19:47.880
I'd love to give it a try.

19:48.110 --> 19:50.160
I even dared to kill

19:50.160 --> 19:51.110
the High Priest of the Youhu Clan.

19:51.680 --> 19:53.000
Why should I fear them?

19:54.510 --> 19:56.590
You're bringing disaster upon Yandu.

19:56.750 --> 19:58.160
That's none of your concern,

19:58.160 --> 19:58.920
Dai.

19:59.750 --> 20:01.270
On my command.

20:02.110 --> 20:03.440
Kill them all!

20:04.680 --> 20:05.480
Stop!

20:16.230 --> 20:17.590
Young City Lord Zhi Yue,

20:18.000 --> 20:19.270
you killed your father to seize power.

20:19.270 --> 20:20.400
Your crime is unforgivable.

20:20.810 --> 20:22.440
By order of Master Yan,

20:23.000 --> 20:24.200
I'm here to arrest you.

20:36.290 --> 20:39.630
[Master Yan's Mansion]

20:43.680 --> 20:45.790
Master Yan, they're here.

20:47.880 --> 20:48.960
Greetings, Master Yan.

21:00.410 --> 21:01.650
Young City Lord Zhi Dai,

21:02.480 --> 21:04.680
after so many years, you still look as young as ever.

21:05.070 --> 21:06.580
It's truly enviable.

21:07.640 --> 21:08.440
Master Yan,

21:08.750 --> 21:10.000
you've changed quite a bit.

21:10.440 --> 21:11.880
If I'd seen you on the street,

21:12.000 --> 21:13.510
I'm afraid I wouldn't have recognized you.

21:13.510 --> 21:15.680
How could I not age after 50 years?

21:15.920 --> 21:17.510
Unlike immortals, we humans

21:17.510 --> 21:18.750
live for a short time.

21:18.830 --> 21:20.350
Among my people,

21:20.550 --> 21:22.310
I'm considered quite long-lived.

21:26.160 --> 21:28.590
This must be Mr. Tanghua.

21:31.680 --> 21:32.960
So it was for him

21:33.270 --> 21:34.640
that you didn't return home for decades?

21:34.920 --> 21:35.880
Master Yan.

21:36.310 --> 21:37.200
In the past few years,

21:37.510 --> 21:39.160
whenever your father got drunk,

21:39.260 --> 21:40.090
he would come to me

21:40.110 --> 21:41.870
and curse this guy for hours,

21:42.510 --> 21:44.480
grumbling nonstop and swearing like a sailor.

21:44.720 --> 21:46.310
Even village women quarreling

21:46.790 --> 21:48.160
couldn't match his variety of insults.

21:50.550 --> 21:52.000
Mr. Tanghua, please don't take offense.

21:52.240 --> 21:53.920
All parents are like this.

21:54.030 --> 21:55.240
No matter what foolish things their child

21:55.240 --> 21:56.270
has done

21:56.440 --> 21:58.000
to land them in trouble,

21:58.070 --> 21:59.070
deep down,

21:59.550 --> 22:01.590
they think it's someone else's fault.

22:01.920 --> 22:03.200
It's kind of you to say that.

22:04.920 --> 22:06.720
This really was my fault.

22:06.880 --> 22:07.830
If he were alive

22:07.830 --> 22:09.310
and heard you say this,

22:10.350 --> 22:12.110
he would surely feel much better.

22:13.920 --> 22:16.030
Master Yan, do you know how my father

22:16.030 --> 22:17.030
died?

22:18.960 --> 22:19.750
I do.

22:20.420 --> 22:21.940
Did you find out afterward,

22:22.480 --> 22:23.270
or did you...

22:23.590 --> 22:25.260
I guess I saw it coming.

22:26.070 --> 22:27.680
I know what you want to ask.

22:29.480 --> 22:30.960
You've been away from home for too long.

22:31.680 --> 22:33.510
You don't understand how the human race has changed.

22:33.960 --> 22:35.000
Over all these years,

22:35.590 --> 22:37.070
with the development of craftsmanship,

22:37.270 --> 22:39.310
every trade has made progress.

22:39.960 --> 22:41.680
We now have waterwheels and plows,

22:41.790 --> 22:43.160
allowing us to grow more crops

22:43.160 --> 22:44.640
and feed more people.

22:44.640 --> 22:46.000
With barrel carts and tower ships,

22:46.250 --> 22:47.560
we can now, like immortals,

22:47.580 --> 22:49.990
fly through the sky and travel underground at high speeds.

22:50.240 --> 22:52.200
We can now withstand floods and earthquakes,

22:52.270 --> 22:53.640
split mountains, and cleave the earth.

22:54.270 --> 22:56.270
We also have rockets and crossbows,

22:56.860 --> 22:58.310
so we can hold our own even against

22:58.340 --> 22:59.310
the immortal cultivators.

22:59.510 --> 23:00.790
We've grown stronger

23:01.270 --> 23:02.920
and more capable of protecting ourselves,

23:03.640 --> 23:05.550
so naturally, our mindset has changed.

23:06.510 --> 23:08.070
Your brother Zhi Yue believes

23:08.200 --> 23:09.000
this is a great opportunity

23:09.000 --> 23:10.720
for the human race to thrive

23:10.960 --> 23:13.030
and sees the Youhu Clan as our greatest enemy.

23:13.240 --> 23:14.720
So, he's been working behind the scenes,

23:14.720 --> 23:15.640
using every possible means

23:15.640 --> 23:17.310
to infiltrate various forces.

23:17.590 --> 23:18.680
For all these years,

23:19.400 --> 23:21.350
he's been dedicated to weakening the Youhu Clan,

23:21.550 --> 23:23.070
waiting for the chance to destroy them.

23:24.030 --> 23:25.110
What about my father?

23:25.180 --> 23:26.490
Your father believed

23:27.000 --> 23:28.550
our progress

23:28.550 --> 23:29.880
was meant to protect ourselves,

23:30.160 --> 23:32.070
not to invade others.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.960
Young City Lord Zhi Dai,

23:34.200 --> 23:35.510
who do you agree with?

23:41.480 --> 23:42.270
Master Yan,

23:42.800 --> 23:44.800
I've spent years wallowing in heartbreak,

23:44.900 --> 23:45.990
losing track of time.

23:46.330 --> 23:47.590
I went to many places

23:47.590 --> 23:49.000
and saw countless sights.

23:50.070 --> 23:51.000
During my travels,

23:51.140 --> 23:52.410
I noticed something strange.

23:53.550 --> 23:54.920
If a mountain

23:54.970 --> 23:56.160
becomes overrun with wolves,

23:56.550 --> 23:57.310
and they wipe out

23:57.310 --> 23:58.750
all their enemies like tigers and leopards,

23:58.960 --> 23:59.920
then soon enough,

24:00.070 --> 24:01.480
they'll eat all the rabbits,

24:01.480 --> 24:02.510
all the mice,

24:02.640 --> 24:03.960
and all the food there is.

24:04.240 --> 24:05.400
And when that happens,

24:05.750 --> 24:07.270
they'll either move to another mountain

24:07.480 --> 24:08.270
or end up

24:08.480 --> 24:10.310
starving to death on that very mountain.

24:10.680 --> 24:11.640
But on the contrary,

24:11.920 --> 24:13.160
if a mountain

24:13.160 --> 24:14.550
has wolves, tigers,

24:14.720 --> 24:16.200
birds, and rabbits,

24:16.790 --> 24:17.880
then that mountain

24:17.920 --> 24:19.110
will be full of life.

24:19.680 --> 24:20.920
Even the flowers, grass, and trees

24:20.920 --> 24:22.400
will grow more lushly.

24:23.550 --> 24:24.480
So?

24:25.200 --> 24:26.350
Nothing in this world

24:26.350 --> 24:27.550
exists in isolation.

24:28.000 --> 24:29.070
Everything is

24:29.070 --> 24:30.750
born into this world for a reason.

24:31.510 --> 24:32.960
Thinking, striving,

24:33.200 --> 24:35.480
and working hard to survive is not wrong.

24:36.270 --> 24:37.830
But if you make eliminating rivals

24:37.830 --> 24:38.720
and wiping out enemies

24:38.720 --> 24:40.000
your primary goal,

24:40.240 --> 24:41.680
you'll lose sight of what truly matters.

24:42.830 --> 24:43.720
So, Master Yan,

24:44.070 --> 24:45.030
in my view,

24:45.210 --> 24:47.450
developing ourselves and competing without destruction

24:47.720 --> 24:49.610
should be the path for the human race.

24:53.750 --> 24:54.790
Mr. Tanghua,

24:55.430 --> 24:56.630
you've taken quite a scolding over the years,

24:56.650 --> 24:58.020
and honestly, you deserved it.

24:58.550 --> 24:59.550
You nearly stole away

24:59.550 --> 25:01.400
the hope for the human race's revival.

25:02.110 --> 25:03.350
City Lord was too soft-hearted.

25:03.350 --> 25:04.350
If I were him,

25:04.480 --> 25:05.670
I'd have gone to Fangwai Mountain long ago

25:05.690 --> 25:06.850
to bring you back by force

25:06.880 --> 25:08.480
and make you marry her.

25:08.640 --> 25:09.530
Master Yan.

25:11.550 --> 25:12.480
A few days ago,

25:12.960 --> 25:14.960
someone said something to me.

25:16.300 --> 25:17.100
She said,

25:17.640 --> 25:19.310
"All things in the four seasons,

25:19.960 --> 25:21.400
in their rise and fall,

25:21.830 --> 25:24.070
will find their own path

25:24.510 --> 25:26.640
without relying on a demon's guidance."

25:27.400 --> 25:28.920
I planned to share those words

25:29.790 --> 25:30.960
with Zhi Yue,

25:31.480 --> 25:32.470
but now

25:33.250 --> 25:35.090
I want to share them with you as well.

25:38.960 --> 25:40.030
Master Yan, what are you doing?

25:42.000 --> 25:43.000
City Lord Zhi Dai,

25:43.750 --> 25:45.030
from now on,

25:45.390 --> 25:46.760
please lead the human race

25:46.860 --> 25:48.620
away from the demons' schemes

25:48.650 --> 25:49.850
and traps,

25:51.240 --> 25:54.580
and guide us toward prosperity.

26:35.830 --> 26:37.920
Are you here to laugh at me

26:38.590 --> 26:40.550
or to give me a quick end?

26:42.180 --> 26:43.740
You killed Father.

26:49.070 --> 26:49.880
Yes.

26:52.590 --> 26:54.200
I killed Father.

26:56.670 --> 26:58.190
I committed a heinous crime.

26:58.680 --> 27:00.110
I'm unforgivable.

27:00.750 --> 27:02.350
I'm different from you.

27:03.920 --> 27:06.270
You're just a sentimental woman.

27:07.400 --> 27:08.350
But I…

27:09.160 --> 27:11.070
I spent my childhood studying and training hard,

27:11.350 --> 27:13.270
never daring to waste a minute.

27:14.200 --> 27:16.030
I did it all so that one day

27:16.440 --> 27:18.350
I could become the City Lord

27:18.400 --> 27:21.050
and lead the human race to greatness!

27:21.920 --> 27:23.680
The War Demons are nothing.

27:24.070 --> 27:25.640
Without me, they would've starved to death

27:25.640 --> 27:26.750
in some godforsaken mountain!

27:27.790 --> 27:31.550
The Youhu Clan is hypocritical, greedy,

27:32.000 --> 27:33.310
arrogant,

27:33.720 --> 27:35.270
yet short-sighted.

27:36.000 --> 27:37.990
Give me just 10 more years,

27:38.680 --> 27:40.550
and I could tear them apart,

27:40.550 --> 27:41.530
leave them at my mercy,

27:41.550 --> 27:43.750
and make the human race the rulers of it all!

27:44.480 --> 27:46.310
I had everything planned.

27:46.590 --> 27:47.750
If not for you...

27:49.070 --> 27:49.880
I wouldn't have

27:49.880 --> 27:51.350
ended up like this,

27:51.460 --> 27:53.590
and I wouldn't have become a prisoner!

27:55.480 --> 27:56.640
Why did you bring back

27:56.640 --> 27:57.640
that pill?

27:58.790 --> 28:00.440
Since you had the heart to leave home,

28:00.440 --> 28:02.240
why did you come back?

28:03.720 --> 28:05.200
You still don't repent.

28:07.400 --> 28:08.310
Repent?

28:10.000 --> 28:11.200
What is there to repent?

28:12.240 --> 28:13.030
Since ancient times,

28:13.350 --> 28:15.960
the world has played by the law of the jungle.

28:15.960 --> 28:17.400
This is the heavenly way!

28:18.070 --> 28:20.000
I just had bad luck.

28:21.270 --> 28:22.400
One wrong move,

28:22.850 --> 28:24.170
and I lost everything.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.270
Fine, I lost.

28:26.510 --> 28:27.310
I accept that.

28:28.640 --> 28:29.920
Everything I did was for the human race,

28:30.590 --> 28:32.640
so I have no regrets.

28:34.240 --> 28:35.310
I don't understand.

28:38.480 --> 28:39.270
No,

28:40.270 --> 28:41.720
of course you don't understand.

28:43.640 --> 28:45.350
You will never understand.

28:45.920 --> 28:46.720
Zhi Yue,

28:49.350 --> 28:51.000
though we're siblings,

28:51.790 --> 28:53.440
we've never really spent much time together.

28:53.720 --> 28:55.040
So when you wanted to kill me,

28:55.270 --> 28:56.440
I could understand that.

28:58.030 --> 28:59.270
But Father,

29:00.440 --> 29:01.480
even to me—

29:01.480 --> 29:03.310
his stubborn, rebellious daughter—

29:03.310 --> 29:05.110
was always loving and forgiving.

29:05.900 --> 29:06.950
I don't believe he had only been

29:06.980 --> 29:08.540
harsh and strict with you.

29:09.680 --> 29:10.550
Didn't he teach you

29:10.550 --> 29:11.830
martial arts and how to read?

29:12.520 --> 29:13.670
Didn't he teach you

29:13.690 --> 29:15.210
to be a man of honor?

29:16.310 --> 29:17.640
When you were little,

29:17.790 --> 29:18.920
didn't he ever kiss you

29:18.920 --> 29:19.960
and hold you in his arms?

29:20.640 --> 29:21.920
When you were sick,

29:22.350 --> 29:23.680
didn't he stay up all night

29:23.680 --> 29:24.880
to take care of you?

29:25.650 --> 29:27.130
So why do you,

29:27.160 --> 29:28.200
after killing

29:28.200 --> 29:29.110
your own father,

29:29.110 --> 29:30.310
act like it was

29:30.310 --> 29:32.150
the most natural thing in the world?

29:35.830 --> 29:37.720
Father taught me to read when I was young.

29:38.830 --> 29:40.310
We once discussed a passage about the character "human"

29:40.720 --> 29:41.880
from "Explaining Graphs and Analyzing Characters."

29:42.310 --> 29:43.350
It says that

29:44.030 --> 29:44.830
humans

29:45.480 --> 29:46.960
are the heart of heaven and earth,

29:47.200 --> 29:48.440
the intersection of yin and yang,

29:48.960 --> 29:50.200
the combination of ghosts and gods,

29:50.200 --> 29:51.440
and the essence of the five elements.

29:52.480 --> 29:54.370
They're the most precious existence in this world.

29:56.440 --> 29:58.110
If you want to lead the human race,

29:58.750 --> 30:01.190
you must at least know how to be a human.

30:03.350 --> 30:04.160
Zhi Yue,

30:04.640 --> 30:05.880
even Master Yan knows

30:05.880 --> 30:07.400
what you did.

30:07.880 --> 30:10.030
He knows you bore ill intentions toward Father.

30:10.590 --> 30:12.160
Father was such a wise man.

30:12.250 --> 30:14.160
How could he not have noticed?

30:15.110 --> 30:16.680
As the Young City Lord of Yandu,

30:16.880 --> 30:18.200
you may use any means

30:18.200 --> 30:19.310
to achieve your goals.

30:19.750 --> 30:21.200
But as a son,

30:21.200 --> 30:23.310
you killed your own father.

30:23.640 --> 30:26.030
How are you any different from a beast?

30:30.960 --> 30:32.240
I won't come again.

30:56.680 --> 30:57.480
Over there.

30:57.820 --> 30:58.510
Let's go.

31:09.720 --> 31:10.750
It's all my fault.

31:31.790 --> 31:33.790
I, Li Chaoyang, Chief of the War Demons,

31:33.960 --> 31:36.720
humbly ask the goddess for help.

31:47.270 --> 31:49.480
The rich fragrance fills the heaven and earth.

31:50.310 --> 31:52.480
This scent reaches the Gate of Heaven.

31:53.070 --> 31:55.030
With the scent stretching thousands of miles,

31:55.270 --> 31:57.920
I offer prayers from afar, invoking the goddess to show herself.

32:18.720 --> 32:20.640
Goddess, we followed your instructions

32:20.640 --> 32:21.750
and surrounded Yuanzhong to kill him.

32:22.460 --> 32:24.370
But at the crucial moment, Ji Tanyin interfered,

32:24.640 --> 32:26.400
ruining our perfect plan

32:26.590 --> 32:27.720
and saving him.

32:28.720 --> 32:31.550
Goddess, we humbly ask for your guidance.

32:54.720 --> 32:57.240
We failed to kill Yuanzhong again and again.

32:57.920 --> 32:58.720
Perhaps…

32:59.510 --> 33:01.550
the goddess has abandoned us.

33:09.750 --> 33:11.200
As long as we find him

33:11.580 --> 33:12.540
and kill him,

33:13.310 --> 33:15.000
we'll still have hope.

33:17.560 --> 33:20.650
The War Demons will still have hope.

33:41.680 --> 33:43.640
Yeah, why didn't we think of

33:43.660 --> 33:44.830
bringing a tent?

33:44.830 --> 33:46.880
It would've sheltered us from the wind and rain.

33:48.400 --> 33:49.200
Miss,

33:49.510 --> 33:50.790
our meeting must be fate.

33:50.920 --> 33:52.650
May I

33:52.680 --> 33:54.310
use your fire?

34:03.040 --> 34:04.110
Great.

34:12.670 --> 34:15.070
This gentleman looks quite familiar.

34:16.760 --> 34:18.110
I remember now.

34:18.179 --> 34:19.580
Back when I went to Qiguan Mountain

34:19.600 --> 34:20.600
to locate a burial site,

34:20.630 --> 34:21.590
I got lost

34:21.590 --> 34:22.710
and saw him.

34:23.190 --> 34:24.880
I even gave him a fortune reading for free.

34:25.030 --> 34:25.960
Unfortunately,

34:26.040 --> 34:27.840
he didn't appear

34:28.480 --> 34:29.960
to believe me at the time.

34:32.190 --> 34:33.100
I have water here

34:33.120 --> 34:33.960
and some hot soup too.

34:34.139 --> 34:35.949
If you don't mind,

34:35.980 --> 34:36.730
you're welcome to take some.

34:36.750 --> 34:37.590
No, thanks.

34:42.070 --> 34:43.489
Your friend

34:44.880 --> 34:46.510
seems to be badly injured.

34:47.480 --> 34:48.880
This pot of Ten-Tonic Soup

34:48.880 --> 34:50.760
is what I use for health and longevity.

34:50.760 --> 34:52.510
It can help with his condition.

34:56.770 --> 34:59.370
The bamboo here is quite special.

34:59.400 --> 35:01.070
It has an unusual fragrance,

35:01.270 --> 35:02.810
which is why this place is called Fragrant Grove.

35:02.840 --> 35:04.230
During the day, it's normal,

35:04.310 --> 35:05.590
but once night falls,

35:05.610 --> 35:07.920
it releases a mist

35:08.090 --> 35:09.900
that makes it easy to get lost

35:09.920 --> 35:11.080
and hard to find a way out.

35:12.110 --> 35:13.070
I've been stuck here

35:13.070 --> 35:15.280
for a full 10 days now.

35:15.440 --> 35:16.960
If you could go out during the day,

35:17.030 --> 35:18.110
why didn't you leave?

35:18.900 --> 35:19.690
Good question!

35:20.000 --> 35:21.670
That day, I read my fortunes,

35:21.670 --> 35:23.510
and the reading kept pointing to this place.

35:23.510 --> 35:24.590
The reading told me

35:24.630 --> 35:26.110
I should stay here for 10 days.

35:26.400 --> 35:27.840
But in the past 9 days,

35:27.980 --> 35:29.170
no one came, and nothing happened.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.880
On the very last day,

35:31.000 --> 35:32.230
you guys showed up.

35:32.670 --> 35:33.960
It must be fate.

35:35.110 --> 35:35.920
Oh right,

35:35.920 --> 35:37.630
I haven't done today's reading yet.

35:37.630 --> 35:39.150
I'll just read your fortunes.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.760
Gods, enlighten me.

35:56.510 --> 35:58.040
Looks like it's going to be

35:58.140 --> 35:59.580
the Five-Star Heavenly Divination!

36:05.110 --> 36:06.230
It's done!

36:06.960 --> 36:07.760
Miss,

36:07.840 --> 36:09.480
you can ask five questions.

36:12.440 --> 36:14.360
This is the Five-Star Heavenly Divination.

36:14.660 --> 36:16.310
Many fortune tellers could never perform this divination

36:16.340 --> 36:17.900
throughout their whole lives.

36:18.070 --> 36:19.480
I have nothing to ask.

36:19.550 --> 36:21.100
I started this divination for you.

36:21.130 --> 36:23.020
Don't waste it.

36:23.890 --> 36:26.080
How about this? I'll ask on your behalf.

36:27.150 --> 36:30.190
How is this young lady's fortune?

36:33.840 --> 36:36.000
Miss, you're pretty unlucky.

36:36.510 --> 36:38.000
But hey,

36:38.070 --> 36:39.300
bad luck isn't the end of the world.

36:39.320 --> 36:40.720
We can always ask about something else,

36:40.740 --> 36:41.360
right?

36:41.920 --> 36:43.110
You two are a couple, aren't you?

36:43.350 --> 36:44.910
How about I ask about your relationship?

36:45.190 --> 36:47.280
The result can't be too bad this time.

36:48.760 --> 36:51.020
Will this young couple

36:51.050 --> 36:52.200
have a happy ending?

36:54.980 --> 36:56.150
The hexagram of Meng.

36:56.550 --> 36:58.250
Gen is mountain, and Kan is water.

36:58.350 --> 36:59.580
This hexagram means...

37:00.480 --> 37:01.320
Oh no.

37:02.960 --> 37:03.800
What does it mean?

37:04.150 --> 37:05.710
It means a mountain beside a river.

37:05.710 --> 37:08.190
Normally, it signifies going through thick and thin together.

37:08.360 --> 37:09.670
If I had only asked

37:09.730 --> 37:11.090
about your love life

37:11.280 --> 37:13.510
or his love life,

37:13.510 --> 37:15.360
it would've been an auspicious sign.

37:15.400 --> 37:16.710
But the problem is

37:16.710 --> 37:18.670
I asked about you as a couple.

37:18.670 --> 37:19.670
So the meaning has changed.

37:19.670 --> 37:21.480
The mountain is close to the river, but they never truly meet.

37:21.480 --> 37:22.230
You're destined…

37:23.590 --> 37:25.190
to part ways.

37:28.140 --> 37:28.950
Blood!

37:30.590 --> 37:32.400
Could it be a backlash?

37:43.210 --> 37:44.340
Miss, don't take it to heart.

37:44.360 --> 37:45.530
You still have a chance.

37:45.550 --> 37:46.440
Let me ask about

37:46.510 --> 37:48.110
how to remedy it.

37:48.840 --> 37:50.150
May I ask myself?

37:50.190 --> 37:51.320
Of course.

37:51.320 --> 37:52.400
That's even better.

37:57.880 --> 37:59.920
I have a friend who is severely injured

38:00.400 --> 38:01.510
and has been in a coma for a long time.

38:01.610 --> 38:02.290
I want to know

38:02.310 --> 38:03.670
when he will wake up.

38:08.190 --> 38:09.400
How is this possible?

38:16.590 --> 38:17.590
I'm fine.

38:19.030 --> 38:20.590
What does this hexagram mean?

38:20.960 --> 38:22.670
Heaven's secrets cannot be revealed.

38:23.510 --> 38:24.840
To reveal them is to invite death.

38:27.940 --> 38:28.850
Perhaps

38:29.390 --> 38:30.990
I can give you some hints.

38:31.760 --> 38:32.550
Please, go ahead.

38:32.810 --> 38:35.370
The hexagram shows a turning millstone.

38:35.400 --> 38:37.920
Just go with the flow.

38:38.000 --> 38:39.770
Don't hesitate to do good things.

38:39.800 --> 38:40.930
Rushing things…

38:42.150 --> 38:43.480
will only lead to mistakes.

38:46.480 --> 38:48.360
Why can't I even give hints?

38:48.880 --> 38:50.590
Do you mean...

38:50.610 --> 38:52.090
Don't ask! Don't say anything.

38:58.550 --> 39:00.190
This hexagram has passed.

39:01.510 --> 39:02.670
You have two questions left.

39:06.880 --> 39:07.920
I want to know if Yuanzhong

39:08.320 --> 39:10.190
can make it through this crisis.

39:19.300 --> 39:20.910
I didn't ask that.

39:21.710 --> 39:25.070
Why am I punished?

39:28.550 --> 39:30.550
You can't answer that question either, right?

39:30.840 --> 39:32.470
I'm glad you understand.

39:33.110 --> 39:33.920
Thank you.

39:34.510 --> 39:37.500
You have one last question.

39:38.510 --> 39:39.320
Wait.

39:39.570 --> 39:41.030
Please don't ask any questions

39:41.050 --> 39:42.050
that may get me killed.

39:45.590 --> 39:46.480
I want to know

39:47.110 --> 39:48.960
how Yuanzhong will end.

39:50.140 --> 39:51.180
I asked that question

39:51.280 --> 39:53.400
for him before.

39:53.880 --> 39:55.880
Everything will go smoothly for him.

40:24.510 --> 40:25.440
You're awake.

40:30.820 --> 40:32.050
I've been awake for a while.

40:33.550 --> 40:34.360
You…

40:45.440 --> 40:46.630
What happened to your eyes?

40:47.960 --> 40:49.630
I was hit by a hidden weapon from the human race.

40:50.840 --> 40:51.960
It's temporary.

40:51.960 --> 40:53.070
Don't worry.

40:53.580 --> 40:54.700
I have the Divine Left Hand.

40:54.840 --> 40:56.670
It can heal any injury.

40:57.190 --> 40:58.590
I'll be fine in a few days.

41:13.630 --> 41:14.480
Thank you for everything

41:15.440 --> 41:16.480
you did along the way.

41:17.960 --> 41:18.920
Don't mention it.

41:20.030 --> 41:21.190
Don't worry about me.

41:22.070 --> 41:23.440
I'll be fine in a few days.

41:27.760 --> 41:28.550
We're

41:29.550 --> 41:30.800
in Fragrant Grove, right?

41:38.010 --> 41:40.450
You woke up twice while you were unconscious.

41:41.360 --> 41:42.590
You gave me directions.

41:45.280 --> 41:46.440
Then we're at the right place.

41:50.440 --> 41:51.480
Mind your step.

41:56.000 --> 41:57.400
A friend of mine

41:57.830 --> 41:59.100
lives in Fragrant Grove.

41:59.730 --> 42:01.610
She's skilled in creating barriers.

42:02.060 --> 42:03.130
We can stay here

42:03.160 --> 42:03.970
for a while.

42:09.810 --> 42:10.530
Stop hiding.

42:11.120 --> 42:11.930
Come out.
